sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant IS as Inventory Service
    participant R as Redis
    participant PGI as PostgreSQL (inventory_service)
    MQ->>IS: deliver OrderPlaced
    IS->>PGI: Inbox: MessageId processed? (no)
    IS->>R: EVAL reserve.lua
    R-->>IS: RESERVED (stock − 1, order added to the reserved set)
    IS-xPGI: one transaction: result Outbox row StockReserved + Inbox row: write refused
    Note over IS: not acknowledged, retried after 1, 2, 4 s, then the service DLQ
    Note over PGI: write allowed again (or the dead letter replayed)
    IS->>R: EVAL reserve.lua (same OrderId)
    R-->>IS: DUPLICATE (nothing deducted again)
    IS->>PGI: one transaction: StockReserved Outbox row + Inbox row
    IS-->>MQ: ack
    Note over R,PGI: exactly one unit taken for the order
